{"zh":[{"start":2.44,"end":4.99,"text":"这是你的望远镜。"},{"start":5.28,"end":7.36,"text":"一项工程奇迹。"},{"start":7.51,"end":9.92,"text":"一台探索利器。"},{"start":10.26,"end":12.55,"text":"用它回望过去，"},{"start":12.59,"end":16.82,"text":"探索大爆炸之后形成的第一批星系；"},{"start":17.78,"end":21.56,"text":"窥探绕恒星运行的行星的大气。"},{"start":21.84,"end":27.31,"text":"它是你看向未知、未曾想象之处的目镜。"},{"start":31.5,"end":35.02,"text":"这是有史以来最大、最复杂、"},{"start":35.06,"end":38.83,"text":"最具挑战的空间望远镜。"},{"start":38.89,"end":41.5,"text":"它将改变我们对宇宙的认识，"},{"start":41.54,"end":43.49,"text":"以及我们在宇宙中的位置。"},{"start":43.73,"end":46.3,"text":"詹姆斯·韦布空间望远镜。"},{"start":55.18,"end":59.23,"text":"它配有有史以来送上太空的最大主镜；"},{"start":59.28,"end":62.54,"text":"口径 6.5 米，是哈勃空间望远镜主镜的"},{"start":62.58,"end":66.55,"text":"六倍多。"},{"start":68.58,"end":72.27,"text":"韦布的四台尖端红外仪器和相机"},{"start":72.31,"end":75.53,"text":"在超低温下工作；"},{"start":75.93,"end":78.93,"text":"比冥王星表面还冷。"},{"start":81.79,"end":86.76,"text":"能这么冷，靠的是有史以来送上太空的最大遮阳罩；"},{"start":86.79,"end":89.88,"text":"一个五层、网球场大小的遮阳罩，"},{"start":89.93,"end":93.55,"text":"挡住来自太阳、地球和月亮的热。"},{"start":98.72,"end":100.61,"text":"韦布将是第一台"},{"start":100.66,"end":104.48,"text":"探测到宇宙中最遥远星系的光的望远镜。"},{"start":105.14,"end":109.7,"text":"这些第一批星系大约形成于 135 亿年前，"},{"start":109.73,"end":113.55,"text":"也就是大爆炸之后仅仅三亿年左右。"},{"start":114.25,"end":116.69,"text":"韦布搭载先进技术，"},{"start":116.74,"end":121.04,"text":"来解答关于宇宙的一些最根本的问题。"},{"start":121.31,"end":124.06,"text":"第一批星系是怎样形成和演化的？"},{"start":124.21,"end":127.2,"text":"别的世界上有没有生命基本组成单元的"},{"start":127.24,"end":128.79,"text":"化学特征？"},{"start":129.09,"end":131.18,"text":"我们的太阳系是独一无二的吗？"},{"start":135.59,"end":140.77,"text":"把这么大的望远镜送上太空，是一项惊人的工程挑战。"},{"start":141.24,"end":146.2,"text":"完全展开的韦布太大，任何火箭整流罩都装不下。"},{"start":146.23,"end":150.87,"text":"工程师把它设计成可以像折纸一样折起来，塞进"},{"start":150.92,"end":155.95,"text":"欧洲空间局直径 5 米的阿丽亚娜 5 号火箭整流罩里。"},{"start":159.28,"end":163.56,"text":"发射后，地面控制人员远程展开韦布。"},{"start":164.2,"end":167.14,"text":"展开过程是一场精巧的芭蕾。"},{"start":167.5,"end":171.55,"text":"将近三周里，控制人员小心地把韦布展开。"},{"start":171.76,"end":175.99,"text":"这场精细的舞蹈之后，韦布的金色镜面要精确对准，"},{"start":176.03,"end":179.59,"text":"靠的是每块六边形镜片背后的马达，"},{"start":179.64,"end":183.68,"text":"调整它们，组成一面完美的镜子。"},{"start":184.17,"end":188.51,"text":"仪器一冷却下来，探索就开始了。"},{"start":189.4,"end":193.25,"text":"韦布是一项前所未有的技术挑战。"},{"start":193.28,"end":195.77,"text":"它诞生于成千上万人的努力，"},{"start":195.79,"end":198.83,"text":"来自美国、加拿大和欧洲。"},{"start":199.71,"end":203.56,"text":"詹姆斯·韦布空间望远镜是你的望远镜。"},{"start":203.63,"end":205.47,"text":"用它去探索。"},{"start":205.5,"end":207.28,"text":"去挑战理论。"},{"start":207.31,"end":209.49,"text":"去看见从未见过的景象。"},{"start":209.69,"end":215.45,"text":"由你来展开宇宙的美与奥秘，还有……"},{"start":215.5,"end":217.25,"text":"我们在其中的位置。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":2.44,"end":4.99,"text":"This is your telescope.","words":[["This","这"],["is","是"],["your","你的"],["telescope.","望远镜"]]},{"start":5.28,"end":7.36,"text":"An engineering marvel.","words":[["An","一个"],["engineering","工程"],["marvel.","奇迹"]]},{"start":7.51,"end":9.92,"text":"An exploration powerhouse.","words":[["An","一个"],["exploration","探索"],["powerhouse.","强大机器"]]},{"start":10.26,"end":12.55,"text":"Use it to look back in time","words":[["Use","用"],["it","它"],["to","去"],["look","看"],["back","回"],["in","在"],["time","时间"]]},{"start":12.59,"end":16.82,"text":"and explore the first galaxies that formed after the Big Bang;","words":[["and","和"],["explore","探索"],["the","这"],["first","第一批"],["galaxies","星系"],["that","那"],["formed","形成"],["after","在…后"],["the","这"],["Big","大"],["Bang;","爆炸"]]},{"start":17.78,"end":21.56,"text":"to peer into atmospheres of planets orbiting the stars.","words":[["to","去"],["peer","窥"],["into","进"],["atmospheres","大气"],["of","的"],["planets","行星"],["orbiting","环绕"],["the","这"],["stars.","恒星"]]},{"start":21.84,"end":27.31,"text":"It’s your eye-piece to the uncharted, unknown and unimagined.","words":[["It’s","它是"],["your","你的"],["eye-piece","目镜"],["to","向"],["the","这"],["uncharted,","未知的"],["unknown","未知"],["and","和"],["unimagined.","未曾想象的"]]},{"start":31.5,"end":35.02,"text":"This is the largest, most complex","words":[["This","这"],["is","是"],["the","这"],["largest,","最大"],["most","最"],["complex","复杂"]]},{"start":35.06,"end":38.83,"text":"and challenging space telescope ever constructed.","words":[["and","和"],["challenging","具挑战的"],["space","空间"],["telescope","望远镜"],["ever","曾经"],["constructed.","建造"]]},{"start":38.89,"end":41.5,"text":"It will change our understanding of the universe","words":[["It","它"],["will","将"],["change","改变"],["our","我们的"],["understanding","理解"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["universe","宇宙"]]},{"start":41.54,"end":43.49,"text":"and our place in it.","words":[["and","和"],["our","我们的"],["place","位置"],["in","在"],["it.","它"]]},{"start":43.73,"end":46.3,"text":"The James Webb Space Telescope.","words":[["The","这"],["James","詹姆斯"],["Webb","韦布"],["Space","空间"],["Telescope.","望远镜"]]},{"start":55.18,"end":59.23,"text":"Equipped with the largest primary mirror ever to be flown in space;","words":[["Equipped","配备"],["with","有"],["the","这"],["largest","最大"],["primary","主"],["mirror","镜"],["ever","曾经"],["to","去"],["be","被"],["flown","飞"],["in","在"],["space;","太空"]]},{"start":59.28,"end":62.54,"text":"at 6.5 meters, it’s more than 6 times","words":[["at","达"],["6.5","6.5"],["meters,","米"],["it’s","它是"],["more","多"],["than","于"],["6","6"],["times","倍"]]},{"start":62.58,"end":66.55,"text":"the size of the Hubble Space Telescope primary mirror.","words":[["the","这"],["size","大小"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["Space","空间"],["Telescope","望远镜"],["primary","主"],["mirror.","镜"]]},{"start":68.58,"end":72.27,"text":"Webb’s four, cutting-edge, infrared instruments and cameras","words":[["Webb’s","韦布的"],["four,","四台"],["cutting-edge,","尖端"],["infrared","红外"],["instruments","仪器"],["and","和"],["cameras","相机"]]},{"start":72.31,"end":75.53,"text":"operate at super cold temperatures;","words":[["operate","工作"],["at","在"],["super","超"],["cold","冷"],["temperatures;","温度"]]},{"start":75.93,"end":78.93,"text":"temperatures colder than the surface of Pluto.","words":[["temperatures","温度"],["colder","更冷"],["than","比"],["the","这"],["surface","表面"],["of","的"],["Pluto.","冥王星"]]},{"start":81.79,"end":86.76,"text":"Getting this cold is done with the help of the largest sunshield ever flown;","words":[["Getting","达到"],["this","这"],["cold","冷"],["is","是"],["done","做到"],["with","借助"],["the","这"],["help","帮助"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["largest","最大"],["sunshield","遮阳罩"],["ever","曾经"],["flown;","飞"]]},{"start":86.79,"end":89.88,"text":"a 5-layer, tennis court-size sunshield","words":[["a","一个"],["5-layer,","5层"],["tennis","网球"],["court-size","场大小的"],["sunshield","遮阳罩"]]},{"start":89.93,"end":93.55,"text":"that blocks heat from the Sun, Earth and Moon.","words":[["that","那"],["blocks","挡住"],["heat","热"],["from","来自"],["the","这"],["Sun,","太阳"],["Earth","地球"],["and","和"],["Moon.","月亮"]]},{"start":98.72,"end":100.61,"text":"Webb will be the first telescope","words":[["Webb","韦布"],["will","将"],["be","是"],["the","这"],["first","第一台"],["telescope","望远镜"]]},{"start":100.66,"end":104.48,"text":"to detect light from the most distant galaxies in the Universe.","words":[["to","去"],["detect","探测"],["light","光"],["from","来自"],["the","这"],["most","最"],["distant","遥远"],["galaxies","星系"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Universe.","宇宙"]]},{"start":105.14,"end":109.7,"text":"These first galaxies formed about 13.5 billion years ago,","words":[["These","这些"],["first","第一批"],["galaxies","星系"],["formed","形成"],["about","大约"],["13.5","13.5"],["billion","十亿"],["years","年"],["ago,","前"]]},{"start":109.73,"end":113.55,"text":"only 300 or so million years after the Big Bang.","words":[["only","只"],["300","300"],["or","或"],["so","左右"],["million","百万"],["years","年"],["after","在…后"],["the","这"],["Big","大"],["Bang.","爆炸"]]},{"start":114.25,"end":116.69,"text":"Webb carries advanced technologies","words":[["Webb","韦布"],["carries","搭载"],["advanced","先进"],["technologies","技术"]]},{"start":116.74,"end":121.04,"text":"to tackle some of the most fundamental questions about the Universe.","words":[["to","去"],["tackle","解答"],["some","一些"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["most","最"],["fundamental","根本"],["questions","问题"],["about","关于"],["the","这"],["Universe.","宇宙"]]},{"start":121.31,"end":124.06,"text":"How did the first galaxies form and evolve?","words":[["How","怎样"],["did",""],["the","这"],["first","第一批"],["galaxies","星系"],["form","形成"],["and","和"],["evolve?","演化"]]},{"start":124.21,"end":127.2,"text":"Are there chemical signatures of the building-blocks of life","words":[["Are","是"],["there","有"],["chemical","化学"],["signatures","特征"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["building-blocks","基本单元"],["of","的"],["life","生命"]]},{"start":127.24,"end":128.79,"text":"on other worlds?","words":[["on","在"],["other","其他"],["worlds?","世界"]]},{"start":129.09,"end":131.18,"text":"Is our solar system unique?","words":[["Is","是"],["our","我们的"],["solar","太阳"],["system","系"],["unique?","独一无二"]]},{"start":135.59,"end":140.77,"text":"Launching such a large telescope into space is an incredible engineering challenge.","words":[["Launching","发射"],["such","这么"],["a","一台"],["large","大"],["telescope","望远镜"],["into","进"],["space","太空"],["is","是"],["an","一项"],["incredible","惊人的"],["engineering","工程"],["challenge.","挑战"]]},{"start":141.24,"end":146.2,"text":"Fully deployed, Webb is too large to fit inside any rocket fairing.","words":[["Fully","完全"],["deployed,","展开"],["Webb","韦布"],["is","是"],["too","太"],["large","大"],["to","去"],["fit","装"],["inside","在里面"],["any","任何"],["rocket","火箭"],["fairing.","整流罩"]]},{"start":146.23,"end":150.87,"text":"Engineers designed it to be folded, like origami, to squeeze inside","words":[["Engineers","工程师"],["designed","设计"],["it","它"],["to","去"],["be","被"],["folded,","折叠"],["like","像"],["origami,","折纸"],["to","去"],["squeeze","塞"],["inside","进"]]},{"start":150.92,"end":155.95,"text":"the European Space Agency’s 5-meter diameter Ariane 5 rocket fairing.","words":[["the","这"],["European","欧洲"],["Space","空间"],["Agency’s","局的"],["5-meter","5米"],["diameter","直径"],["Ariane","阿丽亚娜"],["5","5"],["rocket","火箭"],["fairing.","整流罩"]]},{"start":159.28,"end":163.56,"text":"After launch, controllers on the ground deploy Webb remotely.","words":[["After","在…后"],["launch,","发射"],["controllers","控制人员"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["ground","地面"],["deploy","展开"],["Webb","韦布"],["remotely.","远程"]]},{"start":164.2,"end":167.14,"text":"Deployment is an intricate ballet.","words":[["Deployment","展开"],["is","是"],["an","一场"],["intricate","精巧的"],["ballet.","芭蕾"]]},{"start":167.5,"end":171.55,"text":"For nearly 3-weeks, controllers carefully unfold Webb.","words":[["For","达"],["nearly","将近"],["3-weeks,","3周"],["controllers","控制人员"],["carefully","小心地"],["unfold","展开"],["Webb.","韦布"]]},{"start":171.76,"end":175.99,"text":"After this delicate dance, Webb’s golden mirrors are precisely aligned","words":[["After","在…后"],["this","这"],["delicate","精细的"],["dance,","舞蹈"],["Webb’s","韦布的"],["golden","金色"],["mirrors","镜面"],["are","是"],["precisely","精确"],["aligned","对准"]]},{"start":176.03,"end":179.59,"text":"using motors behind each hexagonal mirror segment,","words":[["using","使用"],["motors","马达"],["behind","背后"],["each","每块"],["hexagonal","六边形"],["mirror","镜"],["segment,","片"]]},{"start":179.64,"end":183.68,"text":"adjusting them to form one, perfect mirror.","words":[["adjusting","调整"],["them","它们"],["to","去"],["form","组成"],["one,","一面"],["perfect","完美的"],["mirror.","镜子"]]},{"start":184.17,"end":188.51,"text":"Once the instruments are cooled, the exploration will begin.","words":[["Once","一旦"],["the","这"],["instruments","仪器"],["are","是"],["cooled,","冷却"],["the","这"],["exploration","探索"],["will","将"],["begin.","开始"]]},{"start":189.4,"end":193.25,"text":"Webb is a technological challenge like no other.","words":[["Webb","韦布"],["is","是"],["a","一项"],["technological","技术"],["challenge","挑战"],["like","像"],["no","没有"],["other.","别的"]]},{"start":193.28,"end":195.77,"text":"Born of the efforts of thousands of people","words":[["Born","诞生"],["of","于"],["the","这"],["efforts","努力"],["of","的"],["thousands","成千"],["of","的"],["people","人"]]},{"start":195.79,"end":198.83,"text":"across the United States, Canada and Europe.","words":[["across","遍及"],["the","这"],["United","美国"],["States,","国"],["Canada","加拿大"],["and","和"],["Europe.","欧洲"]]},{"start":199.71,"end":203.56,"text":"The James Webb Space Telescope is your telescope.","words":[["The","这"],["James","詹姆斯"],["Webb","韦布"],["Space","空间"],["Telescope","望远镜"],["is","是"],["your","你的"],["telescope.","望远镜"]]},{"start":203.63,"end":205.47,"text":"Use it to explore.","words":[["Use","用"],["it","它"],["to","去"],["explore.","探索"]]},{"start":205.5,"end":207.28,"text":"To challenge theories.","words":[["To","去"],["challenge","挑战"],["theories.","理论"]]},{"start":207.31,"end":209.49,"text":"To see sights yet unseen.","words":[["To","去"],["see","看到"],["sights","景象"],["yet","还"],["unseen.","未见"]]},{"start":209.69,"end":215.45,"text":"It’s yours to unfold the beauty and mystery in the Universe, and…","words":[["It’s","它是"],["yours","你的"],["to","去"],["unfold","展开"],["the","这"],["beauty","美"],["and","和"],["mystery","奥秘"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Universe,","宇宙"],["and…","和…"]]},{"start":215.5,"end":217.25,"text":"our place in it.","words":[["our","我们的"],["place","位置"],["in","在"],["it.","它"]]}]}